---

import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Subheading from "../../components/Subheading.astro";---

<Layout>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="title">
                <h1>2026-27: BIOBUZZ</h1>
            </div>
        </div>
        <Subheading message="Our Humble Beginnings" />
        <div class="text">
            <p>
                When stepping into our first season of First Tech Challenge, we had no idea what to expect.
                Our season started when we were generously given old FTC parts from the now, unfortunately disbanded team 8462, we would not be here without them and FRC team 1014.
                We used what he had to construct some test chassis. We needed to figure out by ourselves how the control pipeline worked, as we come from FLL and FRC backgrounds.
                It took several meetings and late nights to finally get our old Motorola working, but when it did, we became invigorated.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <style>
        .header {
            justify-content: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            display: flex;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        .header h1{
            color: #c83131;
            font-size: 4vw;
            margin: 0 auto;
            justify-content: center;
            display: flex;
            font-family: var(--font-dela-gothic-one);
            text-shadow: rgba(255,0,13,0.9) 0 0 40px;
        }

        .text {
            color: white;
            font-size: 36px;
            justify-content: center;
            display: flex;
            margin: 60px auto 0;
            max-width: 80vw;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: var(--font-geist-pixel);
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 900px) {
            .header h1 {
                font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 3.2rem);
                text-align: center;
            }

            .text {
                max-width: 90%;
                font-size: 1.25rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</Layout>
